# secret VARIABLES (`ANTHROPIC_AUTH_TOKEN`, `GH_TOKEN`, `TK_TOKEN`) and the tool
# list that `dev-rules/templates/cloud-agent-bootstrap.sh` sources; the values
# live in Cursor Dashboard secrets or the local shell. It has been tracked since
# #215 while `*.env` shadowed it, so a fresh clone plus `git add` silently drops
# edits to it. Same shape as the bluegreen policy re-include above.
